flowchart TD
  A[Owner requests production] --> B[Prepare/refresh release branch]
  B --> C[Merge/advance main]
  C --> D[Owner runs dry-run mode in android-production-delivery]
  D --> E[Validate source SHA and ancestry]
  E --> F[EAS version query + Play history checks]
  F --> G{checks pass}
  G -->|yes| H[workflow_dispatch manual approval]
  G -->|no| I[stop before submission]
  H --> J[android-production-delivery build --platform android]
  J --> K[build:view verification]
  K --> L[artifact and identity checks]
  L --> M{approved for upload?}
  M -->|not yet| N[manual upload to Internal Testing]
  N --> O[QA + monitoring]
  M -->|future iOS| P[No automatic iOS flow]
